DTO 清单：
- CreateCategoryRequest { categoryCode, capacity（可空，@Positive), expectedVersion, requestId }
- CategoryResponse { raceId, categoryCode, capacity, status, activeCount?, createdAt, sealedAt } — 含当前在赛人数有用。加 activeCount。
- WithdrawRunnerRequest { expectedVersion, requestId }
- SubmitReclassApplicationRequest { applicationId, bib, targetCategory, reason, expectedVersion, requestId }
- ReclassApplicationResponse { applicationId, raceId, bib, targetCategory, reason, status, batchId, createdAt, decidedAt }
- ApproveReclassRequest { reclassKey, operator, expectedVersion, applicationIds }
- ReclassRecordResponse { batchId, bib, fromCategory, toCategory, prevRank, prevStatus, prevFinishTimeMs, prevPenaltyMs, prevTotalTimeMs, createdAt }
- ReclassApprovalResponse { raceId, version, batchId, records: List<ReclassRecordResponse>, standings: Map<String, List<ResultEntryResponse>> } — 两组（来源+目标）排名。
- RejectReclassRequest { expectedVersion, requestId }
- SealCategoryRequest { expectedVersion, requestId }
- CategoryStandingResponse { raceId, categoryCode, version, status（组别状态）, sealedAt?, entries: List<ResultEntryResponse> }
- CategorySnapshotResponse { raceId, categoryCode, version, sealedAt, entries } — 可与 CategoryStandingResponse 共用？组别排名查询：组别 OPEN 时实时算，SEALED 时返回快照。历史快照列表：List<CategorySnapshotResponse>。用同一个 CategoryStandingResponse 即可。

RunnerResponse 需要加 categoryCode/status 吗？RunnerResponse 现有 (bib, finishTimeMs, createdAt, updatedAt)。加字段会破坏现有测试吗？现有测试可能构造 RunnerResponse 或解析 JSON。查一下 RunnerResponse 用法。为安全，加 category 和 status 字段会有编译影响（ResponseMapper.toRunnerResponse）。现有测试若直接 new RunnerResponse(4 args) 会破。让我 grep。

